msgstr "¿Amosar Saturnu nel mapa celeste?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowSaturn), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:562
msgid "Toggle whether Saturn is drawn in the sky map."
msgstr "Amuesa/Anubre Saturnu nel mapa celeste."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowUranus), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:566
msgid "Draw Uranus in the sky map?"
msgstr "¿Amosar Uranu nel mapa celeste?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowUranus), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:567
msgid "Toggle whether Uranus is drawn in the sky map."
msgstr "Amuesa/Anubre Uranu nel mapa celeste."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowNeptune), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:571
msgid "Draw Neptune in the sky map?"
msgstr "¿Amosar Neptunu nel mapa celeste?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowNeptune), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:572
msgid "Toggle whether Neptune is drawn in the sky map."
msgstr "Amuesa/Anubre Neptunu nel mapa celeste."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowPluto), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:576
msgid "Draw Pluto in the sky map?"
msgstr "¿Amosar Plutón nel mapa celeste?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowPluto), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:577
msgid "Toggle whether Pluto is drawn in the sky map."
msgstr "Amuesa/Anubre Plutón nel mapa celeste."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowStars), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:581
msgid "Draw stars in the sky map?"
msgstr "¿Amosar estrelles nel mapa celeste?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowStars), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:582
msgid "Toggle whether stars are drawn in the sky map."
msgstr "Amuesa/Anubre les estrelles nel mapa celeste."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowStarMagnitudes), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:586
msgid "Label star magnitudes in the sky map?"
msgstr "¿Etiquetar les magnitúes estelares nel mapa celeste?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowStarMagnitudes), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:587
msgid ""
"Toggle whether star magnitude (brightness) labels are shown in the sky map."
msgstr ""
"Amuesa/Anubre etiquetes coles magnitúes (el rellumu) estelares nel mapa "
"celeste."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowStarNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:591
msgid "Label star names in the sky map?"
msgstr "¿Etiquetar les estrelles nel mapa celeste?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowStarNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:592
