msgstr "Amuesa/Anubre etiquetes colos nomes de les estrelles nel mapa celeste."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowDeepSkyMagnitudes), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:596
msgid "Label deep-sky object magnitudes in the sky map?"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowDeepSkyMagnitudes), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:597
msgid ""
"Toggle whether deep-sky object magnitude (brightness) labels are shown in "
"the sky map."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowDeepSkyNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:601
msgid "Label deep-sky objects in the sky map?"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowDeepSkyNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:602
msgid "Toggle whether deep-sky object name labels are shown in the sky map."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SlewTimeScale), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:606
msgid "Minimum timescale for forced-slewing mode"
msgstr "Escala temporal mínima pa mou forzado de tránsito."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (SlewTimeScale), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:607
msgid "The timescale above which slewing mode is forced on at all times."
msgstr ""
"La escala de tiempos por encima de la cual el mou de tránsito ye forzado "
"siempres."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (BoxBGMode), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:611
msgid "InfoBoxes Background fill mode"
msgstr "Mou de relleno del fondu del panel informativu"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (BoxBGMode), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:612
msgid ""
"The background fill mode for the on-screen information boxes: 0=\"no BG\"; 1="
"\"semi-transparent BG\"; 2=\"opaque BG\""
msgstr ""
"El mou de rellenu del fondu pa los paneles informativos: 0=«ensin fondu»; "
"1=«fondu semitresparente»; 2=«fondu opacu»."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Projection), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:616
msgid "Mapping projection algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritmo de proyección."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Projection), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:617
msgid "Algorithm for the mapping projection."
msgstr "Algoritmo pa la proyección de la esfera celeste en un plano."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseAbbrevConstellNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:621
msgid "Use abbreviated constellation names?"
msgstr "¿Usar nomes abreviaos pa los nomes de les constelaciones?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAbbrevConstellNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:622
msgid "Use official IAU abbreviations for constellation names."
msgstr "Usar les abreviatures de la IAU pa los nomes de les constelaciones."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseLatinConstellNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:626
msgid "Use Latin constellation names?"
msgstr "¿Usar nomes de les constelaciones en llatín?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseLatinConstellNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:627
msgid "Use Latin constellation names."
msgstr "Usar nomes de les constelaciones en llatín."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseLocalConstellNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:631
msgid "Use localized constellation names?"
msgstr "¿Usar los nomes traducíos de les constelaciones?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseLocalConstellNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:632
msgid ""
"Use localized constellation names (if localized names are not available, "
"default to Latin names)."
msgstr ""
"Usar los nomes traducíos de les constelaciones. Si los nomes traducíos nun "
"tán disponibles, pásase a los nomes llatinos."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseAltAz), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:636
msgid "Use horizontal coordinate system?"
msgstr "¿Usar el sistema de coordenaes horizontales?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAltAz), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:637
msgid ""
"Display the sky with horizontal coordinates (when false, equatorial "
"coordinates will be used)."
msgstr ""
"Amuesa el mapa celeste en coordenaes horizontales (si ye falso se amuesa en "
"coordenaes ecuatoriales)."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseAutoLabel), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:641
msgid "Automatically label focused object?"
msgstr "¿Axuntar etiqueta de nome al oxetu apuntado?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAutoLabel), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:642
msgid ""
"Toggle whether a centered object automatically gets a name label attached."
msgstr "Amuesa/Anubre automáticamente la etiqueta del nome del oxetu apuntado."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseAutoTrail), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:646 tools/scriptbuilder.cpp:632
msgid "Automatically add trail to centered solar system body?"
msgstr "¿Amestar traza automáticamente al cuerpu del sistema solar apuntado?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAutoTrail), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:647
msgid ""
"Toggle whether a centered solar system object automatically gets a trail "
"attached, as long as it remains centered."
msgstr ""
"Amuesa/Anubre la traza del oxetu del sistema solar mientres este permaneza "
"apuntado."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseHoverLabel), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:651
msgid "Add temporary label on mouse hover?"
msgstr "¿Axuntar etiqueta temporal al mover el mur?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseHoverLabel), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:652
msgid ""
"Toggle whether the object under the mouse cursor gets a transient name label."
msgstr "Amuesa transitoriamente el nome del oxetu baxo'l cursor del mur."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseRefraction), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:656
msgid "Correct positions for atmospheric refraction?"
msgstr "¿Correxir por refraición atmosférica?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseRefraction), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:657
msgid ""
"Toggle whether object positions are corrected for the effects of atmospheric "
"refraction (only applies when horizontal coordinates are used)."
msgstr ""
"Corrixe o non la posición de los oxetos teniendo en cuenta l'efeutu de la "
"refraición atmosférica. Namái ye aplicable cuando s'usen les coordenaes "
"horizontales."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseRelativistic), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:661
msgid ""
"Apply relativistic corrections due to the bending of light in sun's "
"gravitational field"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseRelativistic), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:662
msgid ""
"Toggle whether corrections due to bending of light around the sun are taken "
"into account"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseAntialias), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:666
msgid "Use antialiasing when drawing the screen?"
msgstr "¿Usar dondeáu al dibuxar el mapa?"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAntialias), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:667
msgid ""
"Toggle whether the sky is rendered using antialiasing.  Lines and shapes are "
"smoother with antialiasing, but rendering the screen will take more time."
msgstr ""
"Amuesa'l mapa celeste emplegando dondeáu. Les llinies y formes son más "
"dondes con esti mou, pero consume más tiempu nel procesador."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ZoomFactor), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:671
msgid "Zoom Factor, in pixels per radian"
msgstr "Factor d'ampliación, en píxeles por radián."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ZoomFactor), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:672
msgid "The zoom level, measured in pixels per radian."
msgstr "El nivel d'ampliación (zoom) en píxeles por radián."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MagLimitAsteroid), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:677
msgid "Faint limit for asteroids"
msgstr "Llímite de rellumu p'asteroides"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MagLimitAsteroid), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:678
msgid "The faint magnitude limit for drawing asteroids."
msgstr "El llímite de magnitú pa amosar asteroides."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AsteroidLabelDensity), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:682
msgid "Label density for asteroid names"
msgstr "Etiquetar densidá pa los nomes d'asteroides."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (AsteroidLabelDensity), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:683
msgid "Controls the relative number of asteroid name labels drawn in the map."
msgstr "Remana'l númberu rellativo de nomes d'asteroides dibuxaos nel mapa."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MagLimitDrawDeepSky), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:687
msgid "Faint limit for deep-sky objects"
msgstr "Llímite de rellumu pa oxetos del cielu profundu."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MagLimitDrawDeepSky), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:688
msgid ""
"The faint magnitude limit for drawing deep-sky objects, when fully zoomed in."
msgstr ""
"La magnitú llímite pa dibuxar oxetos del cielu profundu cuando s'amplía al "
"máximu el mapa."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MagLimitDrawDeepSkyZoomOut), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:692
msgid "Faint limit for deep-sky objects when zoomed out"
msgstr "Llímite de rellumu pa los oxetos del cielu profundu al amenorgar zoom"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MagLimitDrawDeepSkyZoomOut), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:693
msgid ""
"The faint magnitude limit for drawing deep-sky objects, when fully zoomed "
"out."
msgstr ""
"Llímite de rellumu pa los oxetos del cielu profundu cuando s'amenorga al "
"máximu el mapa."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowUnknownMagObjects), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:697
msgid "Show deep-sky objects of unknown magnitude"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowUnknownMagObjects), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:698
msgid ""
"When enabled, objects whose magnitudes are unknown, or not available to "
"KStars, are drawn irrespective of the faint limits set."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MagLimitDrawStar), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:703
msgid "Faint limit for stars"
msgstr "Llímite de rellumu pa les estrelles"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MagLimitDrawStar), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:704
msgid "The faint magnitude limit for drawing stars, when fully zoomed in."
msgstr ""
"Magnitú llímite pa dibuxar estrelles cuando s'amplia el mapa al máximu."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (StarDensity), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:708
msgid "Density of stars in the field of view"
msgstr "Densidá d'estrelles nel campu de visión"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (StarDensity), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:709
msgid "Sets the density of stars in the field of view"
msgstr "Fixar la densidá d'estrelles nel campu de visión"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MagLimitDrawStarZoomOut), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:714
msgid "Faint limit for stars when zoomed out"
msgstr "Llímite de rellumu pa les estrelles al allonxar zoom"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MagLimitDrawStarZoomOut), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:715
msgid "The faint magnitude limit for drawing stars, when fully zoomed out."
msgstr ""
"Magnitú llímite pa dibuxar les estrelles cuando'l mapa s'amenorga al máximu."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MagLimitHideStar), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:720
msgid "Faint limit for stars when slewing"
msgstr "Llímite de rellumu pa estrelles nel tránsitu."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MagLimitHideStar), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:721
msgid ""
"The faint magnitude limit for drawing stars, when the map is in motion (only "
"applicable if faint stars are set to be hidden while the map is in motion)."
msgstr ""
"Magnitú llímite pa dibuxar les estrelles cuando'l mapa ta en tránsitu d'una "
"posición a otra. Namái ye aplicable si s'escoyó anubrir les estrelles "
"débiles durante'l tránsitu."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (StarLabelDensity), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:725
msgid "Relative density for star name labels and/or magnitudes"
msgstr "Densidá rellativa de nomes/magnitúes d'estrelles"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (StarLabelDensity), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:726
msgid "The relative density for drawing star name and magnitude labels."
msgstr ""
"La densidá rellativa pa dibuxar etiquetes colos nomes d'estrelles y "
"magnitúes."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DeepSkyLabelDensity), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:730
msgid "Relative density for deep-sky object name labels and/or magnitudes"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DeepSkyLabelDensity), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:731
msgid ""
"The relative density for drawing deep-sky object name and magnitude labels."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DeepSkyLongLabels), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:735
msgid "Show long names in deep-sky object name labels?"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DeepSkyLongLabels), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:736
msgid ""
"If true, long names (common names) for deep-sky objects are shown in the "
"labels."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MaxRadCometName), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:740
msgid "Maximum distance from Sun for labeling comets, in AU"
msgstr "Distancia máxima al Sol pa etiquetar cometes en UA."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MaxRadCometName), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:741
msgid "The maximum solar distance for drawing comets."
msgstr ""
"La distancia máxima al Sol pa dibuxar cometes espresada n'unidaes "
"astronómiques."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseGL), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:746
msgid "Use experimental OpenGL backend (deprecated)."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (RunClock), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:750
#, fuzzy
