#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:2
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can locate objects in the sky by their name.\n"
"\t\t\tUse Ctrl+F, the \"Pointing->Find Object\" menu item, or the \"Find "
"Object\"\n"
"\t\t\tToolbar button.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:10
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To change your Geographic Location,\n"
"\t\t\tuse Ctrl+G, the \"Settings->Geographic...\" menu item,\n"
"\t\t\tor the \"globe\" Toolbar button.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:18
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can Track an object, so it will always be centered\n"
"\t\t\tin the display.<br/>\n"
"\t\t\tUse Ctrl+T, the \"Pointing->Engage Tracking\" menu item, or the \"lock"
"\"\n"
"\t\t\tToolbar button. You can also simply center the object by\n"
"\t\t\tdouble-clicking on it or selecting \"Center and Track\" from the\n"
"\t\t\tobject's popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:29
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The KStars Handbook includes the AstroInfo Project, a series\n"
"\t\t\tof informative articles about Astronomy.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>El manual de KStars inclúi el proyeutu AstroInfo, una riestra\n"
"\t\t\td'artículos informativos sobre astronomía.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:36
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>There are three on-screen \"Info Boxes\" which show data related to "
"the\n"
"\t\t\ttime/date, your geographic location, and the current central position "
"on the\n"
"\t\t\tsky (the focus).  You can drag these boxes with the mouse, and \"shade"
"\" them\n"
"\t\t\tby double-clicking them to show more (or less) information.  You can "
"hide\n"
"\t\t\tthem altogether in the Settings->Info Boxes menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Hai trés «Paneles informativos» na pantalla qu'amuesen datos "
"rellacionaos\n"
"\t\t\tcola hora/data, la posición xeográfica, y la posición central de "
"seguimientu\n"
"\t\t\tnel cielu.  Puede arrastrar estos paneles col mur, y  «anubrilos» \n"
"\t\t\tcalcando dos vegaes sobre ellos p'amosar más (o menos) información. "
"Puede anubrilos\n"
"\t\t\ttoos al empar nel menú Preferencies->Menú de paneles informativos.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:46
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>KStars has a full-screen mode; you can toggle this mode using the\n"
"\t\t\t\"fullscreen\" toolbar button, or by pressing Ctrl+Shift+F.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>KStars dispón d'un mou de pantalla completa; Puede activalu\n"
" o desactivalu emplegando'l botón de la barra de ferramientes\n"
"\t\t\t«pantalla completa», o calcar Ctrl+Mayúscules+F.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:53
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The N,S,E,W keys will point the display at the North,\n"
"\t\t\tSouth, East and West points on the Horizon.  The Z key will point the\n"
"\t\t\tdisplay at the Zenith.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Les tecles N,S,E,O apuntarán el mapa al Norte,\n"
"\t\t\tSur, Este y Oeste sobre l'horizonte respeutivamente. La tecla Z\n"
"\t\t\tapuntará'l mapa haza'l cénit.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:61
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The 0-9 keys will center the display on one of the major solar "
"system\n"
"\t\t\tbodies.  0 centers on the Sun, 3 centers on the Moon; the rest are the "
"eight\n"
"\t\t\tplanets, in order of their distance from the Sun.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Les tecles 0-9 centrarán el mapa sobre uno de los cuerpos mayores "
"del\n"
"\t\t\tsistema solar. El 0 centra nel Sol, el 3 na Lluna; el restu emplégase "
"pa los\n"
"\t\t\tocho planetes n'orde ascendente d'acordies cola so distancia media al "
"Sol.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:69
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>Click and Drag with the mouse to slew the skymap to a new position "
"on\n"
"\t\t\tthe sky.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Calque y arrastre el mur pa mover el mapa del cielu a una nueva\n"
"\t\t\tposición.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:76
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>Double-click with the mouse to center the display on the location\n"
"\t\t\tof the mouse cursor.  If you double-click on an object, KStars will\n"
"\t\t\tautomatically begin tracking it.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Calque dos vegaes col mur pa centrar la pantalla na posición\n"
"\t\t\tdel cursor del mur. Si calca dos vegaes sobre un oxetu, KStars "
"entamará\n"
"\t\t\ta seguilu automáticamente.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:84
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The status bar displays the current sky coordinates of the mouse "
"cursor,\n"
"\t\t\tin both Equatorial and Horizontal coordinate systems.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La barra d'estáu siempres amuesa les coordenaes del cursor,\n"
"\t\t\ttanto nel sistema de coordenaes ecuatorial como nel horizontal.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:91
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The display can be zoomed in or out by spinning your mouse's scroll "
"wheel,\n"
"\t\t\tor by dragging the mouse up or down with the middle mouse button "
"pressed.  You\n"
"\t\t\tcan also use the +/- keys, or the \"Zoom In\"/\"Zoom Out\" items in "
"the toolbar and\n"
"\t\t\tin the View menu.  The Zoom Level can be set manually using the \"Zoom "
"to Angular\n"
"\t\t\tSize\" item in the View menu (Shift+Ctrl+Z), and you can set it "
"graphically by\n"
"\t\t\tholding down the Ctrl button while dragging the mouse to define a "
"rectangle for\n"
"\t\t\tthe new window boundaries.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La pantalla puede acercase o allonxase faciendo xirar la rueda del so "
"mur\n"
"\t\t\to arrastrando'l mur haza arriba y abaxo y calteniendo calcáu el botón\n"
"\t\t\tcentral del mur. Puede tamién usar les tecles +/-, o los elementos\n"
"\t\t\t«Acercar»/«Allonxar» de la barra de ferramientes y del menú Ver. El "
"nivel de\n"
"\t\t\tzoom puede fixase usando l'elementu «Zoom al tamañu angular» del menú\n"
"\t\t\tVer (Mayúscules+Ctrl+Z), y puede fixalu gráficamente calteniendo "
"calcáu\n"
"\t\t\tel botón de Control mientres arrastra el mur pa definir un reutángulu "
"coles\n"
"\t\t\tllendes de la nueva ventana.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:103
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can manually set the coordinates of the central Focus point.\n"
"\t\t\tPress Ctrl+M, or use the \"Pointing->Set Coordinates Manually...\" "
"menu item, and enter\n"
"\t\t\tthe desired coordinates in the popup window.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:111
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To switch between Equatorial and Horizontal coordinate\n"
"\t\t\tsystems, use the \"View->Coordinates\" menu item, or press the "
"spacebar.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Pa pasar del sistema de coordenaes Ecuatorial al Horizontal,\n"
"\t\t\tuse l'elementu de menú «Vista->Coordenaes», o la barra espaciadora. \n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:118
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To set the Time and Date, type Ctrl+S, use the \"Time->Set Time\" "
"menu item,\n"
"\t\t\tor press the \"time\" toolbar button.  Note that dates in KStars can "
"be very\n"
"\t\t\tremote; you can use any year between -50,000 and +50,000.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>P'afitar la data y la hora, use Ctrl+S, l'elementu de menú \n"
"\t\t\t«Tiempu->Afitar tiempu» o calque sobro'l botón del «reló de sable» na\n"
"\t\t\tbarra de ferramientes. Alvierta que les dates en KStars puen ser mui\n"
"\t\t\tremotes; Puede utilizar cualesquier añu ente -50.000 y + 50.000.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:126
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can use Ctrl+E or the \"Time->Set Time to Now\" menu item to "
"synchronize\n"
"\t\t\tthe simulation clock with your CPU clock.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede usar Ctrl+E o «Tiempu->Afitar tiempu a agora» pa sincronizar\n"
"\t\t\tel reló de simulación col so reló de la CPU\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:133
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Spin Box in the Toolbar allows you to adjust the time step\n"
"\t\t\tused by the KStars clock; setting it to \"1.0 sec\" provides \"real "
"time\".\n"
"\t\t\tNote: negative values make time run backwards.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La caxella incremental de la barra de ferramientes permite-y axustar\n"
"\t\t\tel pasu temporal usáu pol reló de KStars. Axustándolu a «1.0 seg»\n"
"\t\t\ttendrá «tiempu real». Valores negativos faen que'l tiempu vaya haza "
"atrás.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:141
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can stop and start the clock with the \"Play/Pause\" button\n"
"\t\t\tin the Toolbar, or with the \"Time->Stop Clock\" menu item.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:148
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can advance the simulation clock forward or backward by a single\n"
"\t\t\ttime step by pressing the \"&gt;\" or \"&lt;\" keys.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede facer avanzar el reló haza adelantre o haza atrás d'un sólu "
"pasu\n"
"\t\t\tcalcando les tecles «&gt;» o «&lt;».\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:155
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>When you click your mouse in the map, the object in the sky nearest\n"
"\t\t\tthe mouse cursor is identified in the status bar.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Cuando vusté calca col mur sobro'l mapa, l'oxetu del cielu más\n"
"\t\t\tpróximu al cursor del mur queda identificáu na barra d'estáu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:162
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>When you hold the mouse cursor still for a moment, the nearest "
"object\n"
"\t\t\twill be identified by a temporary name label that automatically fades\n"
"\t\t\tout when you move the mouse again.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Cuando caltién el cursor del mur quietu durante un momentu, l'oxetu\n"
"\t\t\tmás averáu identificaráse con una etiqueta temporal col so nome que\n"
"\t\t\tautomáticamente desapaecerá al mover el mur de nuevu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:170
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>Right-click with the mouse to open a popup menu of detailed options\n"
"\t\t\tfor a particular object, including links to images and information on\n"
"\t\t\tthe Internet.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Calque col botón derechu del mur p'abrir un menú emerxente\n"
"\t\t\tcon opciones detallaes d'un oxetu en particular, incluyendo enllaces\n"
"\t\t\ta imáxenes ya información n'internet.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:178
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The deep-sky objects with a special color (the default is Red)\n"
"\t\t\thave extra URL links available in their popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Los oxetos del espaciu profundu con un color especial (el predefiníu "
"ye'l roxu)\n"
"\t\t\tdisponen d'enllaces URL estra disponibles nel so menú emerxente.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:185
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>By default, stars in KStars are displayed with realistic colors.\n"
"\t\t\tA star's color depends on its temperature; cooler stars are red,\n"
"\t\t\twhile hotter stars are blue.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Por omisión, les estrelles amuésense en KStars con colores "
"realistes.\n"
"\t\t\tEl color d'una estrella depende de la so temperatura; les estrelles "
"más fríes\n"
"\t\t\tson bermeyes, mientres que les más calecíes son azules.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:193
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>If you want the very latest orbital information for asteroids and\n"
"\t\t\tcomets (including recently-discovered objects), check the \"Download\n"
"\t\t\tData\" tool (\"File->Download New Data\" or Ctrl+D) frequently for "
"updated\n"
"\t\t\tephemerides.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:202
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Details window provides a large amount of information on any \n"
"\t\t\tobject in the sky, including coordinates, rise/set times, Internet \n"
"\t\t\tlinks, and your own custom notes.  Access the Details window through \n"
"\t\t\tthe popup menu, or by clicking on an object and then pressing \"D\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:211
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can attach a name label to any object in the sky.  Toggle the \n"
"\t\t\tlabel in the popup menu, or by clicking on the object and then \n"
"\t\t\tpressing \"L\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede adosar una etiqueta con un nome a cualesquier oxetu del cielu.\n"
"\t\t\tConseñe la etiqueta nel menú emerxente, calque sobre l'oxetu y "
"dempués\n"
"\t\t\tcalque «L».\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:219
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The KStars Astrocalculator (Ctrl+C) gives you direct access to many \n"
"\t\t\tof the calculations that KStars does behind-the-scenes.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La calculadora de KStars (Ctrl+C) proporcióna-y accesu direutu a "
"munchos\n"
"\t\t\tde los cálculos que KStars fai baxo los bastidores.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:226
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The AAVSO Light Curve Generator tool (Ctrl+V) connects to a server at "
"the\n"
"\t\t\tAmerican Association of Variable Star Observers, and constructs a\n"
"\t\t\tlightcurve for any of the 6000+ variable stars that they monitor\n"
"\t\t\ton a daily basis.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La ferramienta de xenerador de curves de AAVSO conéutase a un\n"
"\t\t\tsirvidor na American Association of Variable Star Observers, y\n"
"\t\t\tconstrúi una curva de brillu pa les más de 6000 estrelles variables "
"que\n"
"\t\t\tmonitoricen diariamente.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:235
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Altitude vs. Time tool (Ctrl+A) will plot altitude curves for any "
"group\n"
"\t\t\tof objects that you select.  This is a great tool for planning\n"
"\t\t\tobserving sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La ferramienta de Altor frente a Tiempu dibuxa curves d'altor pa\n"
"\t\t\tcualesquier grupu d'oxetos que vusté esbille. Ye una ferramienta\n"
"\t\t\testupenda pa planificar sesiones d'observación.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:243
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>With the What's Up Tonight? tool (Ctrl+U), you can tell at a glance "
"what\n"
"\t\t\tobjects will be visible from your location on a given night.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Cola ferramienta de ¿Qué hai esta nueche?, puede saber d'un vistazu\n"
"\t\t\tqué oxetos sedrán adicables dende la so posición pa una nueche dada.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:250
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Observing List tool (Ctrl+L) gives you easy access to a selected "
"group \n"
"\t\t\tof objects.  Add objects to the list through the popup menu, or by\n"
"\t\t\tclicking on the object, and pressing \"O\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La ferramienta Llista de Observación (Ctrl+L) proporcióna-y accesu\n"
" \t\t\tcenciellu a un grupu esbilláu d'oxetos. Amieste oxetos a traviés del "
"menú\n"
"\t\t\temerxente o calcando sobre un oxetu, y calcando dempués «O».\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:258
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The ScriptBuilder tool allows you to construct complex D-Bus\n"
"\t\t\tscripts using a simple GUI.  The scripts can be played back later\n"
"\t\t\tfrom the command line, or from within KStars.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:266
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Solar System Viewer tool (Ctrl+Y) shows an overhead view of the "
"solar\n"
"\t\t\tsystem, showing the positions of the major planets for the current\n"
"\t\t\tsimulation date.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La ferramienta visor del sistema solar amuesa una vista superior del\n"
"\t\t\tsistema solar, amoando les posiciones de los planetes mayores pa\n"
"\t\t\tla data especificada.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:274
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Jupiter Moons tool (Ctrl+J) shows the relative positions of "
"Jupiter's\n"
"\t\t\tfour largest moons (Io, Europa, Ganymede and Callisto), as seen from\n"
"\t\t\tEarth, and as a function of time.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La ferramienta de les llunes de Xúpiter amuesa les posiciones "
"rellativas\n"
"\t\t\tde les cuatro llunes más grandes (Io, Europa, Ganímedes y Calisto) en "
"función\n"
"\t\t\tdel tiempu talo y como s'adiquen dende la Tierra.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:282
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can export the sky image to a file using the \"Save Sky Image\"\n"
"\t\t\titem in the File menu, or by pressing Ctrl+I.  In addition, you can\n"
"\t\t\trun KStars from a command prompt with the \"--dump\" argument to save "
"a\n"
"\t\t\tsky image to disk without even opening the program window.  This can\n"
"\t\t\tbe used to generate dynamic wallpaper for your KDE desktop.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Esporte la imaxe del cielu a ficheru usando l'elementu \"Guardar "
"Imaxe\n"
"\t\t\tdel Cielu\" nel menú Ficheru, o calcando Ctrl+I. Arriendes puede "
"executar\n"
"\t\t\tKStars dende la llinia d'órdenes col argumentu «--dump» p'atroxar una\n"
"\t\t\timaxe del cielu al discu ensin tener qu'abrir la ventana del "
"programa.\n"
"\t\t\tEsto pue usase pa xenerar un papel tapiz dinámicu del so escritoriu "
"KDE\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:292
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To add your own custom Object Catalogs, select \"Import Catalog\" "
"or \n"
"\t\t\t\"Load Catalog\" from the Catalogs tab in the KStars Configuration "
"window.\n"
"\t\t\tSee the Handbook for instructions on formatting your catalog file.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:300
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To add your own custom image/information URLs to\n"
"\t\t\tany object, select \"Add Link...\" from the object's popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>P'amestar les sos URLs personalizaes d'imaxe/información a\n"
"\t\t\tcualesquier oxetu, esbille «Amestar enllaz...» dende'l menú "
"emerxente.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:307
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can adjust dozens of display options by clicking the\n"
"\t\t\t\"configure\" Toolbar button, or selecting the \"Settings->Configure "
"KStars...\"\n"
"\t\t\tmenu item.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede axustar docenes d'opciones de pantalla calcando'l botón\n"
"\t\t\tde configuración na barra de ferramientes, o esbillando l'elementu de "
"menú\n"
"\t\t\t«Preferencies->Configurar KStars...».\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:315
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The on-screen Info Boxes can be hidden or shown using the\n"
"\t\t\t\"Settings->Info Boxes\" menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede anubrir los paneles informativos de la pantalla\n"
"\t\t\tseleicionando les preferencies nel menú «Preferencies->Paneles "
"informativos».\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:322
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Toolbars can be hidden or shown using the \"Settings->Toolbars\" "
"menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede anubrir la barra de ferramientes esbillando les preferencies\n"
"\t\t\tnel menú «Preferencies->Barra de ferramientes».\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:328
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can hide either the Ra/Dec or Az/Alt coordinate fields in the "
"statusbar,\n"
"\t\t\tor hide the statusbar completely, using the Settings->Statusbar menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:335
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can easily switch between predefined color schemes by selecting\n"
"\t\t\tthe scheme from the \"Settings->Color Schemes\" menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede camudar cenciellamente ente colores predefiníos esbillando\n"
"\t\t\tl'esquema dende'l menú «Preferencies->Esquemes de color».\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:342
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>You can define your own Color Schemes.  Adjust the colors\n"
#| "\t\t\tin the Configuration Window's \"Colors\" Tab, and then press the "
#| "\"Save\n"
#| "\t\t\tCurrent Colors\" button. Your Color Scheme will appear in the list "
#| "in\n"
#| "\t\t\tall future sessions.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can define your own Geographic Locations.  Fill in the\n"
"\t\t\trequired fields in the \"Set Geographic Location\" Dialog and then "
"press the\n"
"\t\t\t\"Add City to List\" button. Your Locations will be available in all\n"
"\t\t\tfuture sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede definir el so propiu esquema de colores.  Axuste los colores\n"
"\t\t\tna llingüeta de la ventana de configuración «Colores», y calque'l "
"botón\n"
"\t\t\t«Guardar colores actuales». El so esquema de color aparecerá na llista "
"en\n"
"\t\t\ttoles sesiones futures.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:351
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can define your own Color Schemes.  Adjust the colors\n"
"\t\t\tin the Configuration Window's \"Colors\" Tab, and then press the "
"\"Save\n"
"\t\t\tCurrent Colors\" button. Your Color Scheme will appear in the list in\n"
"\t\t\tall future sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Puede definir el so propiu esquema de colores.  Axuste los colores\n"
"\t\t\tna llingüeta de la ventana de configuración «Colores», y calque'l "
"botón\n"
"\t\t\t«Guardar colores actuales». El so esquema de color aparecerá na llista "
"en\n"
"\t\t\ttoles sesiones futures.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:360
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Add a new field-of-view (FOV) symbol to the list.  You can define the "
#| "size, shape, and color of the new symbol."
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can construct your own field-of-view (FOV) symbols, using the\n"
"\t\t\tFOV Editor from the Settings->FOV Symbols menu.  You can set the "
"angular size, the\n"
"\t\t\tshape, and the color of your new symbols.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"Amestar un nuevu símbolu pal campu de visión a la llista. Puede definir el "
"tamañu, forma, y color del nuevu símbolu."

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:368
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Advanced tab of the KStars Configuration window allows you to "
"fine-tune\n"
"\t\t\tthe behavior of KStars. You can specify whether to correct for "
"atmospheric\n"
"\t\t\trefraction, and whether to use animated slewing. You can also specify "
"which\n"
"\t\t\tobjects are hidden while the display is in motion.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La llingüeta Avanzáu de la ventana de configuración de KStars permíte-"
"y\n"
"\t\t\tfacer axustes finos del comportamientu de KStars.  Puede especificar "
"si deseya\n"
"\t\t\tcorrexir la refraición atmosférica, y si animar el cambéu de posición. "
"Puede\n"
"\t\t\tespecificar qué oxetos s'anubren cuando la pantalla ta en movimientu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:377
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>KStars displays 126,000 stars, 13,000 deep-sky objects, 88 "
"constellations,\n"
"\t\t\tall planets, the Sun, the Moon, thousands of comets and asteroids, and "
"the\n"
"\t\t\tMilky Way.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Kstars amuesa 126.000 estrelles, 13.000 oxetos del espaciu profundu, "
"88 constelaciones,\n"
"\t\t\ttolos planetes, el Sol, la Lluna, miles de cometes y asteroides y la "
"Vía Lláctea.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:385
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The line in the sky that the Sun and all the Planets seem to follow\n"
"\t\t\tis called the Ecliptic.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La llinia nel cielu que paecen siguir el Sol y tolos planetes "
"denómase\n"
"\t\t\tEclíptica.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:392
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>Object positions in KStars include the effects of precession, "
"nutation,\n"
"\t\t\taberration, atmospheric refraction, and light travel time (for "
"planets).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>Les posiciones de los oxetos en KStars inclúin efeutos de precesión, "
"nutación,\n"
"\t\t\taberración, refraición atmosférica, y allanzu pola velocidá finita de "
"la lluz (pa los planetes).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:399
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The nearest star to the Sun is Rigel Kentaurus (alpha Centauri).\n"
"\t\t\tThe brightest star in the sky is Sirius (alpha Canis Majoris).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>La estrella más cercana al sol ye Rigel Centauro (alfa Centauri).\n"
"\t\t\tLa estrella más rellumante del cielu ye Sirio (alfa Canis Majoris).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:406
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The large group of galaxies between Leo, Virgo and Coma Berenices\n"
"\t\t\tis called the Virgo Cluster of Galaxies.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>El gran grupu de galaxes ente Leo, Virgo y Coma Berenices\n"
"\t\t\tdenómase el Cúmulu de les Galaxes de Virgo.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:413
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The large group of clusters and nebulae near the south celestial "
"pole\n"
"\t\t\tare objects in the Large Magellanic Cloud, which is a dwarf galaxy in\n"
"\t\t\torbit around the Milky Way.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>El gran grupu de cúmulos y nebuloses nel polu sur celeste\n"
"\t\t\tson oxetos na Gran Nube de Magallanes, que ye una galaxa enana\n"
"\t\t\tn'órbita al rodiu del Carreru de Santiago o Vía Lláctea\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:421
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Messier Catalog is a list of 110 of the brightest non-stellar "
"objects\n"
"\t\t\tin the sky.  It includes such famous objects as the Orion Nebula (M "
"42), the\n"
"\t\t\tAndromeda Galaxy (M 31), and the Pleiades (M 45).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>El catálogu Messier ye una llista de los 110 oxetos más rellumantes "
"non estelares\n"
"\t\t\tdel cielu . Inclúi oxetos famosos como la nebulosa d'Orión (M 42), "
"la \n"
"\t\t\tGalaxa d'Andrómeda (M 31), y les Pléyades (M 45).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

